description	"The Bounty Hunter - CQC Specialist

This unit equips itself with weapons highly suitable for close range encounters. Jedi and other melee classes should beware this one.

^2Weaponry:
- Golan Arms FC1 Flechette Weapon (3)
-- 8 Alt Fire Mines
- Stouker Concussion Rifle (3)
-- Alt Fire Only
- CR-24 Flame Projector (3)
- 2 Cryo Grenades
- 2 Trip Mines

^8Attributes:
- Electrified Bubble Shield
- Cortosis Armor (1)
- Strength (2)
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- 3 Poison Darts ^3[CS1 Melee]

^2Strengths^7: Devestating at close range, particularly against Jedi.  
^1Weaknesses^7: Effectively useless at long range. Less overall protection than other 1 life gunner classes."